comments.body:
@emirkmo Thanks for opening the issue, and sorry for the long delay on my side. Suffice to say, I've really come around to your point of view here!

> With contracts, explicit is better than implicit and having inferred contracts is going to add a lot of headaches. I would like to suggest instead tooling to generate the yaml, so that contracts are always explicit, as more sustainable long term approach.

I'm 100% with you. I'm going to close this issue as "not planned" - let's discuss the potential approaches to "contract (yaml) generation" over in #11764.
